Task 1 — Package legitimacy + receipt identity gate (checkpoint:human-verify, gate="blocking-human")
Plan: 18-01
Recorded: 2026-08-21

## Why this gate ran

18-RESEARCH.md's Package Legitimacy Audit (`gsd_run query package-legitimacy check
--ecosystem pypi`) returned SUS for all four packages tools/stark-eval/setup.sh
installs: stark-qa, and its transitive torch, torch_geometric, huggingface_hub.
Every SUS verdict traced to the same two checker signal gaps (unknown-downloads;
too-new misreading a recent point-release date as package age), not real
suspicion — but protocol requires a human to confirm package identity before any
`pip install` executes, regardless.

## Evidence presented to the human (executor, this session)

1. stark-qa 1.1.0 — https://pypi.org/project/stark-qa/ — project site
   stark.stanford.edu, source github.com/snap-stanford/stark. Only release on
   PyPI (`pip index versions stark-qa` → `stark-qa (1.1.0)`).
2. torch — https://pypi.org/project/torch/ — pytorch.org.
3. torch-geometric — https://pypi.org/project/torch-geometric/ — actual repo
   github.com/pyg-team/pytorch_geometric.
4. huggingface-hub — https://pypi.org/project/huggingface-hub/ —
   github.com/huggingface/huggingface_hub.

